                        "username": "saye-520"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks Andrew Geissler, as you have mentioned i have submitted the CLA license and got the approval as well.\n\nAnd for my understanding i saw there were around 18 unresolved issues in the comments related to the run-qemu-robot-test.py file so i started from there. Sorry if this is not a valid approach, it will be good if you can let me know how to find the current unresolved or remaining issues that needs to solved so that i can start from there."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Geissler",
                        "email": "geissonator@yahoo.com",
                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "Sure, you can go to https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/openbmc-build-scripts/+/72699, then go to the ... in the upper right, and do a download patch to cherry pick that commit to your local branch. Then you can address the remaining comments up at https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/openbmc-build-scripts/+/72699?tab=comments and commit amend the changes to address the comments and then push that back up into gerrit so we keep everything within that same review. You can then go into gerrit and respond to the comments and resolve them after you push the code up."
                }
            ],
